# All 25 rendered sheets are committed. They are the deliverable — the thing a
# reader opens — so they belong in the repository rather than behind a build step.
#
# They are still generated, so they can go stale against canon. That is visible
# rather than silent: re-run the renderer and any drift shows up as a diff.
#
#   python3 Docs/Design/Vanguards/render_sheet.py --all
#   git diff Docs/Design/Vanguards/sheets/       # empty means the sheets match canon
#
# Re-render after any change to the Character Bible or the Vanguard YAML.
